### 2.4 Reporting Hierarchy

```
Reporting chain query (recursive CTE):

Employee → Reporting Manager → Department Head → VP/Director → CEO

profiles.reporting_manager_id = UUID FK → profiles(id)
departments.head_id = UUID FK → profiles(id)

Approval chain derives from this:
  Leave approval: reporting_manager_id
  Expense approval: reporting_manager_id → department head (if amount > threshold)
  Hiring approval: department head → finance → VP
```

