## 7. PERFORMANCE MANAGEMENT MODEL

### 7.1 Current State

```
CURRENT:
  - HR clicks "Run Global AI Evaluation" button
  - PerformanceEngine.tsx iterates ALL profiles sequentially
  - For each employee: sends task count + shift count to HuggingFace AI
  - AI returns a JSON { score: 85, reason: "..." }
  - Score overwrites profiles.performance_score
  - Entry appended to profiles.performance_history JSONB array
  - 4-second delay between each employee (API rate limiting)
  - Total time for 1000 employees: ~67 minutes
  
PROBLEMS:
  ❌ No human manager review — AI is the sole evaluator
  ❌ No review cycles (quarterly, annual)
  ❌ No goals / KPIs / OKRs
  ❌ No self-assessment by employee
  ❌ No peer review
  ❌ Performance history as unbounded JSONB (1NF violation)
  ❌ Concurrent evaluations clobber each other
  ❌ HF API token hardcoded as fallback
```

